[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19864.19, "timestamp": "05:31:04", "text": "待って、何か方法はある？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19867.548, "timestamp": "05:31:07", "text": "ファームインフィニティ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19870.39, "timestamp": "05:31:10", "text": "銃？実はそれを聞きたかったんです。私 私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19872.628, "timestamp": "05:31:12", "text": "私のためにもっとパワーレベルが必要だ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19895.31, "timestamp": "05:31:35", "text": "いいえ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19899.67, "timestamp": "05:31:39", "text": "払い戻し、銃弾、そして爆弾。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19901.91, "timestamp": "05:31:41", "text": "だから、あれは彼の銃だと思う。だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19903.39, "timestamp": "05:31:43", "text": "それを保管する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19905.628, "timestamp": "05:31:45", "text": "一度"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19908.948, "timestamp": "05:31:48", "text": "ビジネス149号線ですよね？これは必要ない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19912.39, "timestamp": "05:31:52", "text": "良いものがありますよ。"}]